<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian UBCI bank H1 net profit down.</title>
<headline>Tunisian UBCI bank H1 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Union Bancaire pour le Commerce et l'Industrie  UBCI said on Wednesday it made net profit of 6.369 million dinars in the first half of 1996, down from 11.21 million dinars in the same period last year.</p>
<p>UBCI posted net profit of 18.54 million dinars for all of 1995, up from 9.544 million dinars in 1994.</p>
<p>BNP Intercontinentale is among UBCI's main shareholders.</p>
</text>
